          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yakora n'ekihuuku kya Ashera. Anigaza Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli ashagulirana, ashaga abakama bona aba israeli ababaire bamwebembeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu birobye nirwo Hieli owa Betheli yayombekire Yeriko. Kayaizire kwombeka ekitebe kya rwensinga egyo, yatamba Abiramu omuzigaijogwe. Kayaizire kutekamu ebihigi yatamba Segubu omutabani mainukage, nk'okwo Omukama yabaire agambire omu kanwa ka Yoshua eya Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
